: "1304320177941997", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_1304320184608663_6198782155888246274_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w2_WVySpUdUQ7kNvwEh6DQd&_nc_oc=AdrYmLoDLiXDjA_nqrlbxu6AIfTmkb4Gp9TWVT1g16xecqG0pzQxXkclNCnjGjrZirI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBU0Zbb8aRjAdwrzPlC2iMchr7W54KD0lCG-TrK_j5e0A&oe=6A6354A9"}, "display_name": "Crepe Master!", "keywords": ["adventure", "combat", "craft", "magic", "magicalgirl"], "long_description": "# The Cr\u00eape is cooked... unless you save it!\n\nFight an alien invasion with the most legendary weapon ever created:\nA PAN.\n\nSwing, smash, bonk, and launch enemies across the battlefield in fast-paced VR combat. The aliens have stolen the sacred ingredients of the Holy Cr\u00eape, and it's up to you to get them back before earth is doomed forever.\n\nBut you're more than just a warrior. You're Hana, the reincarnation of the Cr\u00eape Goddess.\n\nUse chaotic Cr\u00eape Magic, unleash crazy powers, and turn every battle into chaos.\n\n# Features\n\n**YOUR WEAPON IS\u2026 A PAN!**\n{1464856455317006}\n\nCharge into battle armed with nothing but your Sacred Pan.\n\nSmash through enemy defenses, send aliens flying, recover stolen ingredients, and become the ultimate Cr\u00eape Champion.\n\n**EPIC POSES**\n{1433306058531539}\n\nIn Cr\u00eape Master!, buttons are for looser.\n\nPerform gesture-based spells with your own hands to unleash powerful Cr\u00eape Magic in VR.\n\n**CRAFT TO BOOST YOUR SPELLS**\n{1646149939733127}\n\nNeed more power?\n\nEnter a Crepo-Trance and cook cr\u00eapes faster than humanly possible. Grab ingredients and create magical cr\u00eapes that supercharge your abilities.", "short_description": "Crepe Master is a chaotic VR adventure where you fight an alien invasion with a legendary weapon: a pan. Smash enemies, cast magical Cr\u00eape spells with epic hand gestures, and craft powerful cr\u00eapes to save the Holy Cr\u00eape before it's too late. Saving the world has never been tastier."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://hallucinations-studio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hallucinations Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://hallucinations-studio.com/crepe-master/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27096765983306265"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_1882302779126850_6102458272278061477_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XMftsSv4DZwQ7kNvwG7KWiH&_nc_oc=Adpn8D-lBymQixME5xYnPf4nJDRmj7XokPKaEOaxgVYD8LjDcsCziOMG840Y0C_zEMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDu5ovHFP_7-hvQn3GVRWCo_QEs4FWmYZJ8B4fOZDWW_A&oe=6A637071"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Crepe Master!", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Adventure", "id": "2691890164460465"}, {"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_name": "Fighting", "id": "2710427532541308"}], "release_date": 1778166000, "lastRevisio